# InvestSkill Conventions

## Skill structure

Every skill lives at:
```
plugins/{plugin-name}/skills/my-analysis/SKILL.md
```

The SKILL.md must include YAML frontmatter with:
- `name` — slug used as CLI trigger
- `description` — one-line description shown in /help
- `triggers` — list of slash command aliases
- `args` — list of named arguments with required flag

A copy without frontmatter lives at:
```
prompts/my-analysis.md
```
This is the universal prompt used by Gemini, Copilot, and other non-Claude tools.

## Plugin registration

Every skill must be registered in:
```
plugins/{plugin-name}/.claude-plugin/plugin.json
```

## Adding a new skill checklist

1. [ ] Create `plugins/{plugin-name}/skills/my-analysis/SKILL.md`
2. [ ] Create `prompts/my-analysis.md` (SKILL.md minus frontmatter)
3. [ ] Register in `plugins/{plugin-name}/.claude-plugin/plugin.json`
4. [ ] Update `.cursor/rules/invest-skill.mdc` with new skill reference
5. [ ] Update `.github/copilot-instructions.md`
6. [ ] Update `GEMINI.md`
7. [ ] Update `README.md` features list
8. [ ] Update any `README-*.md` platform-specific guides
9. [ ] Add entry to `CHANGELOG.md`

