## Code conventions

- All analysis scripts live in `/Users/kcw/Documents/US_Stocks/scripts/`
- Scripts use ES modules (`"type": "module"` in package.json)
- Yahoo Finance data fetched via native `fetch()` — no library dependency
- Session crumb cached in module scope for the process lifetime
